# Written by the Kernel, never by you. Tracking them turns each reload into a diff
# nobody authored. The authored model is the source of truth; these are projections.
archmeta/diagnostics/
archmeta/journal/
archmeta/archmeta.log
archmeta/publish.log

# The generated website, rebuilt from the model.
website/
website-debug/

# NOT ignored, on purpose: archmeta/ai-vocabulary.md. It tells an AI assistant which
# element types, relationship types and data points this repository allows, generated
# from the metamodels. Committed, an assistant in a fresh clone has it before the
# Kernel has ever run; the Kernel rewrites it only when the vocabulary changes.

.DS_Store
*.swp
